    <div class="content-block">
      <h2>Our Mission</h2>
      <p>
        PRISM Labs exists to provide ASDAH students with authentic, hands-on technology 
        experiences that go beyond the classroom curriculum. We believe the best way to 
        learn is by doing — by building real projects, solving real problems, and 
        collaborating with real peers.
      </p>
    </div>
    
    <div class="content-block">
      <h2>The PRISM Name</h2>
      <p>
        PRISM stands for our four technology tracks:
      </p>
      <ul class="track-list">
        <li><strong>P</strong>rogramming — Software development, Python, web, AI</li>
        <li><strong>R</strong>efurbishing — Hardware repair, sustainability, OS deployment</li>
        <li><strong>I</strong>nnovation — Design thinking, prototyping, entrepreneurship</li>
        <li><strong>S</strong>ystems Management — IoT, ESP32, sensors, automation</li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        Like a prism disperses white light into a spectrum of colours, PRISM Labs helps 
        students discover their unique technical interests and strengths.
      </p>
    </div>
    
    <div class="content-block">
      <h2>Our Values</h2>
      <div class="values-grid">
        <div class="value-card">
          <h4>🌱 Curiosity</h4>
          <p>Ask questions, explore, experiment. There are no stupid questions here.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="value-card">
          <h4>🤝 Collaboration</h4>
          <p>We rise together. Share knowledge, help others, build as a team.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="value-card">
          <h4>💪 Persistence</h4>
          <p>Things will break. Debugging is learning. Keep going.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="value-card">
